{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_11211770","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211770","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121177001:0":{"text":"タレン様、ではお願いします。どうかあなた様の聖なる炎で、鹿霊の彫像を元に戻してください。","source_cn":"塔琳殿下，接下来就拜托你了，请你用神圣的火焰，让鹿灵雕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A3C74B81370FB47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121177002:1":{"text":"待って。ここを元に戻しても、あのカタストロフはまた次のターゲットを狙うわ。この場でおびき出さないと……","source_cn":"稍等，那个恶魔迟早会转向下一个目标，得引他出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF861F0A03C6035AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121177003:1":{"text":"奴はいつも魔法で作った空間の中に隠れているけど、出現させる方法もあることにはあるのよ。","source_cn":"他习惯躲藏在法术所造的空间里，神出鬼没，但并不是毫无方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93B81C173A3D2869","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121177004:1":{"text":"なぜなら……奴は究極の対称を追求しているから。","source_cn":"——因为他追求极致的对称。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13D731BF730CA031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1121177004":{"text":"なぜなら……奴は究極の対称を追求しているから。","source_cn":"——因为他追求极致的对称。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13D731BF730CA031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_